  "title": "Bacon Wrapped Pork Chops in Zesty Sauce",
  "description": "Here&#39;s a sweet, savory recipe for the slow cooker. Pork chops wrapped in bacon are broiled and then simmered slowly to tenderness in a sweet chili sauce with pineapple chunks.",
